---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Digitful logo candidate 2"
  description="Temporary review page for the corrected Digitful logo candidate."
  canonicalUrl="https://digitful.ca/logo-test/"
>
  <main class="logo-test container">
    <header class="logo-test__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Brand system / candidate 2</p>
      <h1>Back to the approved shape.</h1>
      <p>
        This candidate is traced from the approved logo concept artwork itself. Barlow Condensed is not used for the logo lettering.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="logo-test__section" aria-labelledby="wordmark-heading">
      <div class="logo-test__section-head">
        <p class="logo-test__number">01</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="wordmark-heading">Primary wordmark</h2>
          <p>Review the shape, proportions and coral terminal dot. These are the only decisions being tested here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="logo-test__grid">
        <figure class="logo-swatch logo-swatch--light">
          <img
            src="/assets/brand/candidate-2/digitful-wordmark-on-light.svg"
            alt="Digitful wordmark in ink with coral terminal dot"
            width="1809"
            height="515"
          />
          <figcaption>On light</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="logo-swatch logo-swatch--dark">
          <img
            src="/assets/brand/candidate-2/digitful-wordmark-on-dark.svg"
            alt="Digitful wordmark in cream with coral terminal dot"
            width="1809"
            height="515"
          />
          <figcaption>On dark</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="logo-test__section" aria-labelledby="mark-heading">
      <div class="logo-test__section-head">
        <p class="logo-test__number">02</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="mark-heading">Standalone d.</h2>
          <p>The compact mark keeps the heavier, rounder character from the approved concept.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="logo-test__grid logo-test__grid--marks">
        <figure class="logo-swatch logo-swatch--light logo-swatch--mark">
          <img
            src="/assets/brand/candidate-2/digitful-mark-on-light.svg"
            alt="Digitful d mark in ink with coral terminal dot"
            width="603"
            height="603"
          />
          <figcaption>On light</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="logo-swatch logo-swatch--dark logo-swatch--mark">
          <img
            src="/assets/brand/candidate-2/digitful-mark-on-dark.svg"
            alt="Digitful d mark in cream with coral terminal dot"
            width="603"
            height="603"
          />
          <figcaption>On dark</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="logo-test__section" aria-labelledby="size-heading">
      <div class="logo-test__section-head">
        <p class="logo-test__number">03</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="size-heading">Interface sizes</h2>
          <p>Size rules are not locked yet. This just checks whether the shapes hold up before we finalize usage rules.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="logo-size-test" aria-label="Wordmark size test">
        <div>
          <span>160 px</span>
          <img src="/assets/brand/candidate-2/digitful-wordmark-on-light.svg" alt="" width="160" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>132 px</span>
          <img src="/assets/brand/candidate-2/digitful-wordmark-on-light.svg" alt="" width="132" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>104 px</span>
          <img src="/assets/brand/candidate-2/digitful-wordmark-on-light.svg" alt="" width="104" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .logo-test {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
  }

  .logo-test__intro {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  .logo-test__intro h1 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .logo-test__intro > p:last-child,
  .logo-test__section-head p:last-child {
    max-width: 44rem;
    color: var(--site-text-muted);
  }

  .logo-test__section {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--site-border);
  }

  .logo-test__section-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .logo-test__section-head h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
  }

  .logo-test__number {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display), 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--site-accent);
  }

  .logo-test__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border: 2px solid #191a1b;
  }

  .logo-swatch {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .logo-swatch:first-child {
    border-right: 2px solid #191a1b;
  }

  .logo-swatch img {
    display: block;
    width: min(100%, 42rem);
    height: auto;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .logo-swatch figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .logo-swatch--light {
    color: #191a1b;
    background: #f0e7d5;
  }

  .logo-swatch--dark {
    color: #f0e7d5;
    background: #191a1b;
  }

  .logo-swatch--mark img {
    width: min(13rem, 72%);
  }

  .logo-size-test {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 30rem;
  }

  .logo-size-test > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--site-border-subtle);
  }

  .logo-size-test span {
    color: var(--site-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .logo-size-test img {
    display: block;
    height: auto;
  }

  html[data-theme='dark'] .logo-size-test img,
  :global(html:not([data-theme='light'])) .logo-size-test img {
    background: #f0e7d5;
    padding: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
    .logo-test__section-head {
      grid-template-columns: 2.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .logo-test__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .logo-swatch:first-child {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #191a1b;
    }
  }
</style>
